{"reviewId": "277295564_86CxAew1F", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "没太懂\n", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "13340-13437", "abstract": "固定资产平均使用时间可能代表的是一种产能上的时间结构，而这种固定资产的使用时间结构是代表全球的，不单单是美国的结构，所以我们可以认为，美国固定资产平均使用时间在一定程度上可以代表全球的产能周期。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 16, "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "277295564_86CxAew1F", "userVid": 277295564, "topics": [], "createTime": 1770039709, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 277295564, "name": "Garland", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/9TYrRbL9TyLzox5uKtQq4wVkbrm7kicxsBscvcB4PH2iaWIicsVWre3YyGIbiaBZ8sia0Ck8snNRLbM9dVJ1GXefibsQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "Garland", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 4, "likes": [{"userVid": 16340284, "name": "落", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0025-lamVfiv~Jdy4urrQFgSwk10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "落", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-500", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 500}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "就是这个时间。\n固定资产平均使用时间的上升阶段，就是所谓的机器几年不换一直用，这个阶段固定资产投资是减少的，也是产能周期的下降期，即经济下行期，商品价格应该是下降的。\n固定资产平均使用时间的下降阶段，就是所谓的机器一两年就换或者增加，这个阶段的固定资产投资是增加的，也是产能周期的上升期，即经济上行期，所以，对应此阶段的商品价格是上升的。", "reviewId": "277295564_86CxAew1F", "commentId": "277295564_86CxAew1F_c543003176_88abCEqOR", "userVid": 543003176, "createTime": 1775472413, "likesCount": 3, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 543003176, "name": "曦", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0027-CiKtJrTN9KnvORl~KBM48eb/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1785676343}